  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2026 - WSR mWater Remote Technical Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Remote support: The WSR ERU uses a data management system consisting of a set of Kobo tools, linked to a Power BI dashboard. The WSR ERU is planning to migrate their data management to mWater. This tool is designed for data collection and management of water point data and therefore suitable to be used within the WSR ERU. The objective of this ToR is therefore:
&#x2022;	To advise and support Norwegian Red Cross (NorCross) with the development of a data management system within mWater
Where NLRC WCE and NLRC 510 will have different roles in the support process.</narrative>
  </description>
